UID:culture-moves-europe-residency-hosts-2026-2027@artificialnouveau.github
 .io
DTSTAMP:20261112T145239Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270118
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270119
SUMMARY:Deadline: Culture Moves Europe: Call for Residency Hosts 2026-2027 
 (EUR 50/day per resident for hosting organisations)
DESCRIPTION:The organisation-side strand of Culture Moves Europe\, the EU's
  flagship mobility scheme for artists and cultural professionals\, funds o
 rganisations to host artists in residence.\n\nOrganisation: Culture Moves 
 Europe (Creative Europe\, European Commission)\, implemented by the Goethe
 -Institut\nLocation: Legal entities registered in a Creative Europe countr
 y (including overseas countries and territories and outermost regions)\, h
 osting 1 to 5 residents from other Creative Europe countries.\nAward: Host
 s: EUR 50 per day per resident plus accessibility support of EUR 375\, 675
  or 1\,200 depending on residency length. Residents: EUR 30 per day\, trav
 el allowance of EUR 400 (under 5\,000 km) or EUR 800\, and top-ups for gre
 en travel (EUR 400)\, OCT/outermost regions (EUR 175)\, family (EUR 200 pe
 r child) and visa (EUR 120). No application fee.\nDuration: Residencies fr
 om 12 April 2027 onward\; hosts choose residents and submit residency info
  between 9 March and 31 July 2027.\n\nMore: https://culture.ec.europa.eu/c
 ulture-moves-europe/call-for-residency-hosts?utm_source=artificialnouveaug
 rantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://culture.ec.europa.eu/culture-moves-europe/call-for-residency-ho
 sts?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Legal entities registered in a Creative Europe country (including 
 overseas countries and territories and outermost regions)\, hosting 1 to 5
  residents from other Creative Europe countries.
END:VEVENT
